<mxCell id="raises_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Where each error is raised&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Passenger: InvalidPassengerDetailsError&lt;br&gt;Flight: InvalidCapacityError, InvalidFlightStatusError, FlightStatusChangeError&lt;br&gt;Ticket: InvalidFareError, InvalidBaggageError&lt;br&gt;Booking: BookingStateError, DuplicatePassengerError, WrongObjectTypeError&lt;br&gt;BookingSystem: BookingNotFoundError, FlightNotFoundError, PassengerNotRegisteredError, FlightNotBookableError, FlightFullError, EmptyBookingError, WrongObjectTypeError, DuplicateFlightError&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every request_ method in BookingSystem catches BookingSystemError, reports it, logs it and returns None." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1788" width="760" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
